Description: Switch video encoder from  x264enc to openh264enc
.
Many distros do not ship x264enc due to licensing/patent issues;  openh264enc is available in our gst-plugins-bad package when built with openh264 enabled.
Replaces H.264 encoder element with "openh264enc"; sets bitrate/keyframeinterval to openh264enc gop-size;
x264-only options and time import dropped.
Author: Matthew Ramirez <matthew.ramirez@chainguard.dev>
Forwarded: not-needed

